pport. A Libertarian candidate is on the ballot but polling shows most voters settled on the two major-party nominees.\n\nRecent polls are genuinely mixed: several show Turek narrowly ahead, others put Hinson up two to four points, and averages land around a one-point Democratic edge. Prediction markets nonetheless price Hinson near 58%, and one rater calls the race Tilt R while the rest say Tossup. Healthcare has dominated the debate coverage. This is effectively a coin flip with a slight polling-based Democratic tilt.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.6012, "margin": 1.25}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.5782, "margin": 0.8}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.5857, "margin": 0.8}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.5846, "margin": 0.8}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.4983, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.503, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.579, "margin": 0.8}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.5896, "margin": 0.8}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.5557, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.499, "margin": -0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.5985, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.607, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.6056, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.506, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.5021, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.5425, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.5748, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.4654, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.4669, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.4302, "margin": -0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.495, "margin": -0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.5171, "margin": 0.2}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.5114, "margin": 0.2}]}